WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
I feel like I'm dreaming now

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,920
I didn’t expect that I could still live such a life in the apocalypse, right?

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,240
we are all lucky

4
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,640
These two kids had so much fun these two days, right?

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,800
Thanks to An An for coming

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,800
Xiaoxuan can't play with these adults

7
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,000
It was quite lonely before

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,880
Meeting Xiaoxuan is An An's luck

9
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,480
An An is usually too introverted.

10
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,640
Very bad at making friends

11
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,740
What is Xiaoyun talking about?

12
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,420
I don’t know if it’s an illusion

13
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:27,120
She seems to be deliberately putting Wu Xun between Xiaoyun and me.

14
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,840
The way he looks at me always shows an inexplicable hostility

15
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,470
Talking about children

16
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:33,310
Watching two kids having fun

17
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,030
I am also happy to be a mother

18
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:39,030
Children are safe on base

19
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,190
How could you not stop looking at me at this moment?
